        "dividedDoses": 3
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-proglycem",
          "section": "Dosage and Administration"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "text": {
            "fa": "دقت دوز در شیرخوار بسیار مهم است. فشار ریوی (PH) در نوزاد گزارش شده.",
            "en": "Dose accuracy is critical in infants. Pulmonary hypertension has been reported in newborns."
          },
          "refs": [
